 "id": "x20",
 "name": "MDX OS X.20 B",
 "refuse": "X.20 is currently not supported.",
 "about": "The Machinedrum SPS-1 UW community OS X.20 B (by jmamma). Its loader decodes the OS at boot, so the build never reads the OS image: it re-packs the loader's stage image with a boot routine that writes the sites below once the loader has decoded the OS. The anchors (the bytes X.20 B has at each site) are checked offline against a decoded X.20 B (engine/test/x20.test.ts with KB_X20_OS); the build only accepts the exact X.20 B file (identify.syx_sha256). Addresses, anchors and hashes only: no firmware bytes.",
