  "dyn_labels": {
   "about": "Dynamic knob labels: the parameter page's setup (0x229a6c) looks a machine's record up with findRec (0x217cee) at 0x229a9e; DLREC calls it and, for a machine with dynamic labels, copies the record's names into a RAM buffer, overlays the captions of the stop each labelled knob's MODE is on (the packs' formula) and points rec+8 at the buffer. Caption data in E12B flash, read through the alias from the UI task only. Checked on hardware with the same routines.",
